Bharata performs śrāddha rites on twelfth day --- Bharata gifts brāhmaṇas jewels wealth food cattle servants houses carriages --- Bharata laments grief-stunned at pyre on thirteenth dawn --- Bharata mourns father abandoning him and exiled Rāma --- Śatrughna blames Mantharā sea vowing fire and tapōvana --- Bharata and Śatrughna collapse wailing on ground --- Vasiṣṭha lifts Bharata preaching inevitable pairs --- Sumantra consoles Śatrughna with birth-death truth --- Ministers urge tearful princes to remaining rites
